{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12233050","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12233050","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1223305001:1":{"text":"どうした？顔色が悪いぞ。","source_cn":"脸色不太好啊，哥几个。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE6A65B0311F05F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1223305002:1":{"text":"強盗に遭っちまったよ。マスクを被った集団だ。","source_cn":"被劫票了，对方蒙着脸。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x610485BB8B089EE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1223305003:1":{"text":"全部俺のせいだ。俺がうたた寝したばっかりに……","source_cn":"都怪我，要不是我打瞌睡……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4372607D9B17921C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1223305004:1":{"text":"気にすんな。ここ数日の災難に比べたら、そんなのたいしたことねぇよ。","source_cn":"行吧，比起这些天咱们遇到的，也不算什么大事了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA6870696B75CF34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1223305005:1":{"text":"それにほら、まだ在庫は残ってるんだ。今はこれを売ることに集中しよう。","source_cn":"大家，用备用的货把摊位收拾下，其他的别多想了","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB318566CED60A03D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1223305006:1":{"text":"アル、商品を取り戻すつもりはないのか？","source_cn":"阿尔，不想办法把货追回来吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29190BF9331872D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1223305007:1":{"text":"言っただろ、今はまだ営業中だ。そんな暇ねぇよ。","source_cn":"咱们还要做生意，哪有那么多闲工夫。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07D95B7858254791","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1223305008:1":{"text":"海のギャングが、やられたまま黙ってろと言うのか！？","source_cn":"这可不像咱们的作风！水鬼向来睚眦必报！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CDEDD89FC4407BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1223305009:1":{"text":"やり返すにも、犯人が分からないんだろ？","source_cn":"怎么报？你知道是谁吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA59BE77C619C8B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1223305010:1":{"text":"く……くそっ！","source_cn":"可……可恶！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x954BE1C35ACF5D34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1223305011:1":{"text":"もう終わったことだ。今は目の前のことに集中しよう！","source_cn":"这件事过去了就算了，眼前的事更要紧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7025380E7B8E492","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_r